	(gr_text "1D Pong Instructions:\n- The first and last LED's are your paddles; \nwhen the ball reaches them, press the button to swat it away \n- Each successful landed hit will increase the ball movement speed\n- A miss = loss of a life; no more lives = game over\n- Don't cheat & hold the buttons; you'll lose a life\nMay the best player win!\n\nCheck out the firmware & hardware files for this very card on my GitHub"
